    <h1>Four practice areas, chosen because they move the P&amp;L</h1>
    <p class="lede">Pricing, promotions, portfolio and trade terms sit behind most of the margin in an FMCG business. We work on those four, in depth, and nothing else. Here's what each one looks like in practice.</p>
